        "messages": {
          "message": [
            {
              "content": "You are a professional trader. Return ONLY JSON that matches the schema (no prose, no code fences). Do not refetch quotes. Parse the provided quote_json (stringified JSON) and avg_cost, then compute last_price, unrealized_pl_pct, and unrealized_pl_abs. Apply disciplined risk-management heuristics (lock gains when stretched, cut losses when drawdown is material; otherwise favor patience unless strong, recent catalysts). If market data looks stale, add a caveat. When uncertain, prefer HOLD and lower confidence.",
              "role": "system"
            },
            {
              "content": "=Decide BUY, SELL, or HOLD using the inputs below. Heuristics: if deep drawdown → consider SELL; if large gains → consider SELL (take profit) or HOLD with reasoning; otherwise HOLD unless strong recent catalysts. Keep rationale concise.\\n\\nquote_json:\\n{{ $('Message a model').item.json.choices[0].message.content }}\\n\\navg_cost:\\n{{ $json['avg_cost '] }}\\n\\nticker:\\n{{ $('On form submission').item.json.company_ticker }}\\n\\nReturn strictly JSON per schema. No prose."
            }
          ]
        },
